  Expected OFD.xml for signed.ofd
  Source: ofdrw/ofdrw conventions + GB/T 33190-2016

  Signed document uses Version="1.1" (per GB/T 38540-2020 for signatures).
  The Signatures.xml reference is in Document.xml, not OFD.xml directly.
-->
